sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Teacher
  participant C as evl-coordinator
  participant K as Knowledge base
  participant G as Generator
  participant V as EVL checks
  T->>C: "exam on rational numbers, 7th grade"
  C->>K: topics matching the grade
  K-->>C: basic-math/rational-numbers
  C->>T: confirm level, item types, count, page limit
  T-->>C: Gate A approved
  C->>G: build blueprint (topic x cognitive x type)
  G->>V: verify each candidate
  V-->>G: pass, or redraw (bounded)
  G-->>C: items.json frozen with stable references
  C->>T: answer sheet, solution book and rubric
  Note over C,T: evl-math-reviewer and evl-language-reviewer check authored items only
